# Image Rules (4 Rules)

## 12. Optimize Before Upload
Crop, resize (max 2000px), compress. Under 100KB general, hero under 250KB.

## 13. Astro Image
Use Astro Image for local, urlFor() with auto=format for Sanity. Responsive srcset.

## 14. Dimensions + Lazy
Always set width/height. Lazy load below fold. Hero loads first, never lazy.

## 15. Self-Host Fonts
WOFF2 with font-display: swap. Text shows immediately.
